OL,3,GNEWSA'He was deeply loved': Tribute to
OL,4,Aformer UK school pupil killed in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former pupil at a Scottish high
OL,8,Fschool has been killed in action on the
OL,9,Ffrontline in Ukraine.
OL,11,FArkadii Petrov and his family moved to
OL,12,FDumfries and Galloway when he was a
OL,13,Fteenager, following Russia's invasion
OL,14,Fin 2022.
OL,16,FHe attended Kirkcudbright Academy
OL,17,Fbefore returning to Ukraine to fight
OL,18,Fand was killed in action in the east of
OL,19,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
